{"id":"CVE-2013-4466","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2013-11-19T19:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-09-16T20:21:16.336Z","description":"Buffer overflow in the dane_query_tlsa function in the DANE library (libdane) in GnuTLS 3.1.x before 3.1.15 and 3.2.x before 3.2.5 allows remote servers to cause a denial of service (memory corruption) via a response with more than four DANE entries.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2013/10/25/2","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20131024 Re: CVE Request: gnutls/libdane buffer overflow"},{"url":"http://article.gmane.org/gmane.comp.encryption.gpg.gnutls.devel/7050","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[gnutls-devel] 20131023 gnutls 3.2.5"},{"url":"http://www.gnutls.org/security.html#GNUTLS-SA-2013-3","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://article.gmane.org/gmane.comp.encryption.gpg.gnutls.devel/7049","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[gnutls-devel] 20131023 gnutls 3.1.15"}],"vendors":["crypto-libs"]}
